They are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3
or (at your option) any later version. The full text is in LICENSE.

This part is AGPL because scbinder links the SeisComP libraries
(libseiscomp_client, libseiscomp_core), which are themselves AGPL-3.0; a
work linking them must be distributed under AGPL/GPL-compatible terms.

When redistributing or running a modified scbinder, keep this NOTICE and
the "scbinder — SeisComP port by Mustafa Çomoğlu" attribution intact
